    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 1,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "Mrs. Kennedy? They told me to come up."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 580,
        "text": "I’m just so happy that he could be proud. Because then I was having a baby and I couldn’t campaign and then we got in the White House and all the things I’d always done, suddenly they became wonderful. And I was just so happy for Jack that he could be proud of me."
      }
